0410F3             0134*   
0410F3             0135*   
0410F3             0136*   ; Load all backgrounds, sprites, and DG tiles through one persistent handle.
0410F3             0137*   ; The postcondition guards both catalog drift and callback overrun.
0410F3             0138*   ; outputs: A=0/Z on exact success; AGNB metadata error/NZ otherwise
