041B8A             0206*   ; Loader-owned transfer window. Wolf3D's fixed SRAM is occupied by map and
041B8A             0207*   ; sprite state, so the API cannot assume the harness's 0xB7E000 scratch area.
041B8A 00 00 00 00 0208*   agnb_io_buffer:            blkb 8192,0
