044022             0867*   ; Validate the current RGBA2222 DATA size against width * height.
044022             0868*   ; inputs:  normalized IMAG metadata and DATA size in agnb_metadata
044022             0869*   ; outputs: A=0 and Z set on success
044022             0870*   ;          A=agnb_error_data_size and NZ set on mismatch
