04686A             0291*   ; Exact stabilization whitelist for writable legacy sprite callbacks.
04686A             0292*   ; inputs: iy = validated sprite record, hl = stored callback
04686A             0293*   ; outputs: carry set only for an exact pool/type/program combination
04686A             0294*   ; destroys: a,de,hl
