0469E3             0459*   ; compute a sprite's new position based on its component x,y velocities
0469E3             0460*   ; with screen boundary checking and update its sprite table record accordingly
0469E3             0461*   ; inputs: table_pointer set to sprite record
0469E3             0462*   ; returns: updated x, y positions and edge collision flags in sprite_screen_edge
0469E3             0463*   ; destroys: everything
