047432             0210*   ; deactivate the tile with the given id
047432             0211*   ; inputs: tile_stack_pointer set to record to remove
047432             0212*   ; outputs: decrements num_active_tiles by one, tile_stack_pointer set to record above removed record, removes tile pointer from the tile stack, shifts stack records above it down one position
047432             0213*   ; destroys: a,hl,bc,de
