047476             0242*   ; Remove a malformed stack entry without dereferencing the record pointer.
047476             0243*   ; A record referenced only by a corrupt entry may remain quarantined as alive;
047476             0244*   ; reclaiming an unknown physical record would be less safe than leaking a slot.
